  "name": "03a - Adapter: Ledger Write",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 03a - Adapter: Ledger Write\n\n**Swap point for the real accounting system.**\n\nThis sub-workflow is the ONLY place the pipeline knows how an\ninvoice gets posted. It writes to the Data Table `ap_ledger`,\nan honestly-labelled demo sink that stands in for the GL.\n\nTo go live, replace the single node `Post to ap_ledger` with:\n\n| Target | Node |\n| --- | --- |\n| QuickBooks Online | QuickBooks Online -> Bill -> Create |\n| Xero | Xero -> Invoice (ACCPAY) -> Create |\n| NetSuite / SAP | HTTP Request -> vendor bill endpoint |\n| Generic ERP | HTTP Request -> POST /api/bills |\n\nNothing upstream changes: the input contract below and the\n`{ posted, ledgerRef, sink, postedAt }` output contract stay\nthe same, so the caller never learns which system won.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
